TITLE Albite dissolution with H2S gas
SOLUTION 1
    temp 200
    pH 2 charge
    Fe(3) 0.004
    Fe(2) 0.004
GAS_PHASE 1
    -fixed_pressure
    -pressure 5
    H2S(g) 5
KINETICS 1
    Albite
        -m0 1.0
        -m 1.0
        -parms 1.0 10.0
        -steps 10 in 100
USER_PUNCH
    -head step m_Albite
    10 PUNCH KIN("Albite")
END
